{
  "message": "The devlog reports tides and a two-player boat, but its images show no gameplay. The Godot demos provide starting material, but the playable slice and five-player testing remain unverified, leaving the goal at risk. Next, share an openable build showing both islands, the tide loop and co-op sailing, then record five players testing it. We’ll review again next sprint; I look forward to your build, devlog posts and test notes ;).",
  "agreed": [
    {
      "text": "Share an openable build showing both islands, the tide flooding and draining, and two players crewing the boat.",
      "itemId": null,
      "dueDay": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Have five players test the build and share notes showing what they tried and what happened.",
      "itemId": null,
      "dueDay": null
    }
  ]
}

